'''Necromancer Elite [[Canthan armor]]''' is a prestige armor art available in the Factions campaign.

This armor is only available in the [[Divine Path]], an [[explorable area]] only accessible by completing [[Imperial Sanctum|the final mission]] in Factions. If you plan on buying this armor make sure you take all of the required crafting materials and money into the mission with you, as there are no [[Xunlai Agent]]s, [[material trader]]s, or [[rare material trader]]s available in the zone.

The standard version of this armor is [[Necromancer Canthan armor]].

